      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * LOGIC TO LOAD FIELDS TO THE SCREEN FOR DISPLAY                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       method-id.  To_Screen protected.                                                                                                                                                                 
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * If not Post Back ...                                                                                                                                                                            
      *   If screen was redirected from another screen get the session                                                                                                                                  
      *   number from the screen query pair for "SESSION".                                                                                                                                              
      *    IF NOT Self::IsPostBack                                                                                                                                                                      
      *       MOVE SPACES TO REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION                                                                                                                                                    
      *       SET REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION TO Self::Request::QueryString::Item("SESSION")                                                                                                                
      *       IF REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION NOT = SPACES                                                                                                                                                   
      *          MOVE REDIRECT-SCREEN-SESSION TO THIS-SESSION-ALPHA.                                                                                                                                    
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * If not Post Back ...                                                                                                                                                                            
      *   IF THIS IS A NEW SCREEN THEN READ THE PASSING FILE                                                                                                                                            
      *    IF NOT Self::IsPostBack                                                                                                                                                                      
      *       IF PCIM-FILE-SCREEN NOT = THIS-SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                                
      *           MOVE "R"          TO PASS-ACTION-CODE                                                                                                                                                 
      *           MOVE THIS-SESSION TO PASS-SESSION-NUMBER                                                                                                                                              
      *           MOVE SPACES       TO PASS-SESSION-DATA                                                                                                                                                
      *           MOVE ZERO         TO PASS-STATUS-CODE                                                                                                                                                 
      *           SET PASSINGFILECLASS TO NEW IdealRoutines.PASSINGFILE                                                                                                                                 
      *           INVOKE PASSINGFILECLASS::PASSINGFILEMETHOD(PASS-PARAMETERS)                                                                                                                           
      *           SET PASSINGFILECLASS   TO NULL                                                                                                                                                        
      *           MOVE PASS-SESSION-DATA TO PCIM-FILE-AREA                                                                                                                                              
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-DATA       TO D158999-REC                                                                                                                                              
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-CURSOR     TO D158999-CURSOR                                                                                                                                           
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-ATTRIBUTES TO D158999-ATTR                                                                                                                                             
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-TEMP       TO D158999-TEMP                                                                                                                                             
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-ERROR      TO D158999-ERROR                                                                                                                                            
      *           MOVE PCIM-FILE-RECEIVED   TO D158999-RECEIVED                                                                                                                                         
      *           INVOKE Self::"Pcim_Data_To_Output".                                                                                                                                                   
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * WRITE THE PASSING PARAMETERS TO THE PASSING FILE.                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE "W"            TO PASS-ACTION-CODE                                                                                                                                                      
           MOVE THIS-SESSION   TO PASS-SESSION-NUMBER                                                                                                                                                   
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-AREA TO PASS-SESSION-DATA                                                                                                                                                     
           MOVE ZERO           TO PASS-STATUS-CODE                                                                                                                                                      
           SET PASSINGFILECLASS TO NEW IdealRoutines.PASSINGFILE                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE PASSINGFILECLASS::PASSINGFILEMETHOD(PASS-PARAMETERS)                                                                                                                                  
           SET PASSINGFILECLASS TO NULL.                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * PCIM-FILE-SCREEN contains the name of the screen to be displayed                                                                                                                                
      * If this is not this screen then redirect to the new screen.                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           IF PCIM-FILE-SCREEN NOT = SPACES AND THIS-SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                        
              MOVE SPACES        TO SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                                         
              STRING PCIM-FILE-SCREEN   DELIMITED BY SPACE                                                                                                                                              
                    ".aspx"             DELIMITED BY SIZE                                                                                                                                               
                    "?SESSION="         DELIMITED BY SIZE                                                                                                                                               
                    THIS-SESSION-ALPHA  DELIMITED BY SIZE                                                                                                                                               
                    INTO SCREEN-NAME                                                                                                                                                                    
              SET NEXT-SCREEN   TO SCREEN-NAME::Trim                                                                                                                                                    
              INVOKE Self::Response::Redirect(NEXT-SCREEN).                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * DATA IS FOR THIS SCREEN                                                                                                                                                                         
      * SO SAVE A COPY OF THE SCREEN DATA FROM THE PROGRAM                                                                                                                                              
      * LOAD THE SCREEN FIELDS                                                                                                                                                                          
      * AND SEND THE SCREEN TO THE TERMINAL                                                                                                                                                             
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE Self::"Set_Screen_Cursor".                                                                                                                                                            
           INVOKE Self::"Load_Screen".                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * SET THE FIELD ATTRIBUTES IF ANY HAVE BEEN MODOIFIED                                                                                                                                             
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           INVOKE Self::"Modify_Attributes".                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       end method To_Screen.                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * SUBROUTINES                                                                                                                                                                                     
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * LOAD SCREEN WITH VALUES FROM PROGRAM                                                                                                                                                            
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id.  Load_Screen protected.                                                                                                                                                               
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
           set S_ACTION::Text                           to O-ACTION::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                           
           set S_HSCREEN::Text                          to O-HSCREEN::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                          
           set S_DATE_R::Text                           to O-DATE-R::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                           
           set S_JOBNO::Text                            to O-JOBNO::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                            
           set S_JOBSEQ::Text                           to O-JOBSEQ::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                           
           set S_FA::Text                               to O-FA::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                               
           set S_FA_AUTH::Text                          to O-FA-AUTH::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                          
           set S_USERID_R::Text                         to O-USERID-R::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                         
           set S_ERR_MSG::Text                          to O-ERR-MSG::TrimEnd.                                                                                                                          
           set CPOSN2::Text                             to CURSOR-POSITION-2.                                                                                                                           
           set UCTSESSION::Value                        to THIS-SESSION-ALPHA.                                                                                                                          
           set ACT::Text                                to "1".                                                                                                                                         
       end method Load_Screen.                                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * UNLOAD SCREEN VALUES TO PASS TO PROGRAM                                                                                                                                                         
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id.  Unload_Screen protected.                                                                                                                                                             
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
           set I-ACTION                                 to S_ACTION::Text.                                                                                                                              
           set I-HSCREEN                                to S_HSCREEN::Text.                                                                                                                             
           set I-DATE-R                                 to S_DATE_R::Text.                                                                                                                              
           set I-JOBNO                                  to S_JOBNO::Text.                                                                                                                               
           set I-JOBSEQ                                 to S_JOBSEQ::Text.                                                                                                                              
           set I-FA                                     to S_FA::Text.                                                                                                                                  
           set I-FA-AUTH                                to S_FA_AUTH::Text.                                                                                                                             
           set I-USERID-R                               to S_USERID_R::Text.                                                                                                                            
           set I-ERR-MSG                                to S_ERR_MSG::Text.                                                                                                                             
           set THIS-SESSION-ALPHA                       to UCTSESSION::Value.                                                                                                                           
           set PF-KEYIN                                 to KEYPRESS::Value.                                                                                                                             
           set SCREEN-CURSOR                            to CPOSN::Value.                                                                                                                                
           set CURSOR-POSITION TO Type Convert::ToInt32(SCREEN-CURSOR).                                                                                                                                 
       end method Unload_Screen.                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * LOAD SCREEN WITH FIELD ATTRIBUTES FROM PROGRAM                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id.  Modify_Attributes protected.                                                                                                                                                         
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
       end method Modify_Attributes.                                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * SET SCREEN CURSOR TO FIELD SEND FROM PROGRAM                                                                                                                                                    
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id.  Set_Screen_Cursor protected.                                                                                                                                                         
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
           MOVE "0000"           TO CURSOR-POSITION-2.                                                                                                                                                  
       end method Set_Screen_Cursor.                                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * LOAD SCREEN WITH INITIAL VALUES AND ATTRIBUTES                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id.  Load_Initial_Settings protected.                                                                                                                                                     
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
           MOVE INITIAL-FIELD-ATTRIBUTES TO D158999-ATTR.                                                                                                                                               
           INVOKE Self::Modify_Attributes.                                                                                                                                                              
           MOVE INITIAL-FIELD-VALUES TO  PCIM-FILE-DATA.                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       end method Load_Initial_Settings.                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * PROCESS PFKEYS                                                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id.  Pfkeys protected.                                                                                                                                                                    
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
           IF PF-KEYIN = SPACES                                                                                                                                                                         
              MOVE "00"     TO PF-KEYIN                                                                                                                                                                 
           ELSE                                                                                                                                                                                         
              IF PF-KEYIN(2:1) = SPACE                                                                                                                                                                  
                 MOVE PF-KEYIN(1:1) TO PF-KEYIN(2:1)                                                                                                                                                    
                 MOVE ZERO          TO PF-KEYIN(1:1).                                                                                                                                                   
       end method Pfkeys.                                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * CLEAR THE TEMP ATTRUBUTES                                                                                                                                                                       
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id.  Clear_Temp_Attributes protected.                                                                                                                                                     
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       Clear_Temp_Attributes_Exit.                                                                                                                                                                      
       end method Clear_Temp_Attributes.                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * SET THE CURSOR POSITION FIELD FLAG                                                                                                                                                              
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id.  Set_Field_Cursor_Flag protected.                                                                                                                                                     
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
           MOVE SPACES           TO PCIM-FILE-CURSOR.                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE ALL ZEROES TO D158999-CURSOR.                                                                                                                                                           
           IF CURSOR-POSITION >= 00009 AND <= 00012                                                                                                                                                     
              MOVE 1 TO ACTION-CURSOR.                                                                                                                                                                  
           IF CURSOR-POSITION >= 00126 AND <= 00129                                                                                                                                                     
              MOVE 1 TO HSCREEN-CURSOR.                                                                                                                                                                 
           IF CURSOR-POSITION >= 00148 AND <= 00158                                                                                                                                                     
              MOVE 1 TO DATE-R-CURSOR.                                                                                                                                                                  
           IF CURSOR-POSITION >= 00247 AND <= 00257                                                                                                                                                     
              MOVE 1 TO JOBNO-CURSOR.                                                                                                                                                                   
           IF CURSOR-POSITION >= 00272 AND <= 00274                                                                                                                                                     
              MOVE 1 TO JOBSEQ-CURSOR.                                                                                                                                                                  
           IF CURSOR-POSITION >= 00292 AND <= 00294                                                                                                                                                     
              MOVE 1 TO FA-CURSOR.                                                                                                                                                                      
           IF CURSOR-POSITION >= 00296 AND <= 00303                                                                                                                                                     
              MOVE 1 TO FA-AUTH-CURSOR.                                                                                                                                                                 
           IF CURSOR-POSITION >= 00311 AND <= 00318                                                                                                                                                     
              MOVE 1 TO USERID-R-CURSOR.                                                                                                                                                                
           IF CURSOR-POSITION >= 01761 AND <= 01838                                                                                                                                                     
              MOVE 1 TO ERR-MSG-CURSOR.                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       Set_Field_Cursor_Flag_Exit.                                                                                                                                                                      
       end method Set_Field_Cursor_Flag.                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * SET THE RECEIVED FIELD FLAG                                                                                                                                                                     
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id.  Set_Field_Received_Flag protected.                                                                                                                                                   
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
           MOVE ZEROES           TO D158999-RECEIVED.                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           IF ACTION NOT = SV-ACTION                                                                                                                                                                    
              MOVE 1 TO ACTION-RECEIVED.                                                                                                                                                                
           IF HSCREEN NOT = SV-HSCREEN                                                                                                                                                                  
              MOVE 1 TO HSCREEN-RECEIVED.                                                                                                                                                               
           IF DATE-R NOT = SV-DATE-R                                                                                                                                                                    
              MOVE 1 TO DATE-R-RECEIVED.                                                                                                                                                                
           IF JOBNO NOT = SV-JOBNO                                                                                                                                                                      
              MOVE 1 TO JOBNO-RECEIVED.                                                                                                                                                                 
           IF JOBSEQ NOT = SV-JOBSEQ                                                                                                                                                                    
              MOVE 1 TO JOBSEQ-RECEIVED.                                                                                                                                                                
           IF FA NOT = SV-FA                                                                                                                                                                            
              MOVE 1 TO FA-RECEIVED.                                                                                                                                                                    
           IF FA-AUTH NOT = SV-FA-AUTH                                                                                                                                                                  
              MOVE 1 TO FA-AUTH-RECEIVED.                                                                                                                                                               
           IF USERID-R NOT = SV-USERID-R                                                                                                                                                                
              MOVE 1 TO USERID-R-RECEIVED.                                                                                                                                                              
           IF ERR-MSG NOT = SV-ERR-MSG                                                                                                                                                                  
              MOVE 1 TO ERR-MSG-RECEIVED.                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       Set_Field_Received_Flag_Exit.                                                                                                                                                                    
       end method Set_Field_Received_Flag.                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * PERFORM THE VALIDATION RULES                                                                                                                                                                    
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id.  Validation_Rules protected.                                                                                                                                                          
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
           MOVE SPACES           TO D158999-ERROR.                                                                                                                                                      
           MOVE SPACES           TO PCIM-FILE-ERROR.                                                                                                                                                    
           MOVE ZERO             TO VALIDATION-ERROR.                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       Validation_Rules_Exit.                                                                                                                                                                           
       end method Validation_Rules.                                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * CHECK FIELD CONTAINS ONLY NUMERIC CHARACTERS                                                                                                                                                    
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id.  Check_Numeric_Logic protected.                                                                                                                                                       
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE "Y"       TO WS-NUMERIC-CHECK-FLAG.                                                                                                                                                     
           MOVE ZERO      TO WS-NC-NUMBER-COUNT.                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE ZERO      TO WS-NC-DECIMAL-COUNT.                                                                                                                                                       
           MOVE SPACE     TO WS-NC-DP-FLAG.                                                                                                                                                             
           MOVE SPACE     TO WS-NC-SIGN.                                                                                                                                                                
           MOVE SPACE     TO WS-NC-EXTRA-CHARS.                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * Check for all spaces                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           IF WS-NUMERIC-CHECK = SPACES                                                                                                                                                                 
              GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Exit.                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * Remove $ or ,                                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                         
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-SUB1.                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE SPACES TO WORK-FIELD.                                                                                                                                                                   
       Check_Numeric_Logic_PreLoop.                                                                                                                                                                     
           ADD 1 TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                             
           IF WS-SUB > 20                                                                                                                                                                               
              GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Code.                                                                                                                                                           
           IF WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(WS-SUB:) = SPACES                                                                                                                                                        
              GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Code.                                                                                                                                                           
           IF WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(WS-SUB:1) = "$" OR ","                                                                                                                                                   
              GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_PreLoop.                                                                                                                                                        
           ADD 1 TO WS-SUB1.                                                                                                                                                                            
           MOVE WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(WS-SUB:1) TO                                                                                                                                                           
                      WORK-FIELD(WS-SUB1:1).                                                                                                                                                            
           GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_PreLoop.                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       Check_Numeric_Logic_Code.                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE WORK-FIELD TO WS-NUMERIC-CHECK.                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * Check only contains ., -, +, space, or number                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                         
       Check_Numeric_Logic_Loop_0.                                                                                                                                                                      
           ADD 1 TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                             
           IF WS-SUB < 21                                                                                                                                                                               
              IF WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(WS-SUB:1) = "." OR "-" OR "+" OR " "                                                                                                                                  
                 MOVE "Y"             TO WS-NC-EXTRA-CHARS                                                                                                                                              
                 GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Loop_0                                                                                                                                                       
              END-IF                                                                                                                                                                                    
              IF WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(WS-SUB:1) < 0 OR > 9                                                                                                                                                  
                 MOVE "N" TO WS-NUMERIC-CHECK-FLAG                                                                                                                                                      
                 GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Exit                                                                                                                                                         
              END-IF                                                                                                                                                                                    
              GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Loop_0.                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * Left justify                                                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                         
       Check_Numeric_Logic_Loop_1.                                                                                                                                                                      
           ADD 1 TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                             
           IF WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(1:1) = SPACE                                                                                                                                                             
              MOVE WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(2:) TO WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(1:)                                                                                                                                         
              GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Loop_1.                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * If embedded space then set error flag                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                         
       Check_Numeric_Logic_Loop_2.                                                                                                                                                                      
           ADD 1 TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                             
           IF WS-SUB < 21                                                                                                                                                                               
              IF WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(WS-SUB:1) NOT = SPACE                                                                                                                                                 
                 GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Loop_2                                                                                                                                                       
              ELSE                                                                                                                                                                                      
                 IF WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(WS-SUB:) NOT = SPACES                                                                                                                                              
                    MOVE "N" TO WS-NUMERIC-CHECK-FLAG                                                                                                                                                   
                    GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Exit.                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * Check for only one - or +                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                         
           INSPECT WS-NUMERIC-CHECK TALLYING WS-SUB FOR ALL "-".                                                                                                                                        
           INSPECT WS-NUMERIC-CHECK TALLYING WS-SUB FOR ALL "+".                                                                                                                                        
           IF WS-SUB > 1                                                                                                                                                                                
              MOVE "N" TO WS-NUMERIC-CHECK-FLAG                                                                                                                                                         
              GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Exit.                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                         
           INSPECT WS-NUMERIC-CHECK TALLYING WS-SUB FOR ALL "-".                                                                                                                                        
           IF WS-SUB = 1                                                                                                                                                                                
              MOVE "-" TO WS-NC-SIGN.                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                         
           INSPECT WS-NUMERIC-CHECK TALLYING WS-SUB FOR ALL "+".                                                                                                                                        
           IF WS-SUB = 1                                                                                                                                                                                
              MOVE "+" TO WS-NC-SIGN.                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * Check for only one .                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                         
           INSPECT WS-NUMERIC-CHECK TALLYING WS-SUB FOR ALL ".".                                                                                                                                        
           IF WS-SUB > 1                                                                                                                                                                                
              MOVE "N" TO WS-NUMERIC-CHECK-FLAG                                                                                                                                                         
              GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Exit.                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * If embedded "-" or "+" then set error flag                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                            
       Check_Numeric_Logic_Loop_3.                                                                                                                                                                      
           ADD 1 TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                             
           IF WS-SUB < 20                                                                                                                                                                               
              IF WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(WS-SUB:1) = "-" or "+"                                                                                                                                                
                 IF WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(WS-SUB + 1:) NOT = SPACES                                                                                                                                          
                    MOVE "N" TO WS-NUMERIC-CHECK-FLAG                                                                                                                                                   
                    GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Exit                                                                                                                                                      
                 END-IF                                                                                                                                                                                 
              ELSE                                                                                                                                                                                      
                 GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Loop_3.                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      * Count numeric and decimal characters                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                         
       Check_Numeric_Logic_Loop_4.                                                                                                                                                                      
           ADD 1 TO WS-SUB.                                                                                                                                                                             
           IF WS-SUB < 21                                                                                                                                                                               
              IF WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(WS-SUB:1) = SPACE                                                                                                                                                     
                 MOVE 22 TO WS-SUB                                                                                                                                                                      
              ELSE                                                                                                                                                                                      
                 IF WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(WS-SUB:1) = "-" OR "+"                                                                                                                                             
                    GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Loop_4                                                                                                                                                    
                 ELSE                                                                                                                                                                                   
                    IF WS-NUMERIC-CHECK(WS-SUB:1) = "."                                                                                                                                                 
                       MOVE "Y" TO WS-NC-DP-FLAG                                                                                                                                                        
                       GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Loop_4                                                                                                                                                 
                    ELSE                                                                                                                                                                                
                       IF WS-NC-DP-FLAG = SPACE                                                                                                                                                         
                          ADD 1 TO WS-NC-NUMBER-COUNT                                                                                                                                                   
                       ELSE                                                                                                                                                                             
                          ADD 1 TO WS-NC-DECIMAL-COUNT                                                                                                                                                  
                       END-IF                                                                                                                                                                           
                       GO TO Check_Numeric_Logic_Loop_4.                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
       Check_Numeric_Logic_Exit.                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       end method Check_Numeric_Logic.                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * MOVE PCIM-DATA FIELDS TO OUTPUT FIELDS                                                                                                                                                          
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id. Pcim_Data_To_Output protected.                                                                                                                                                        
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
           MOVE PCIM-FILE-DATA    TO D158999-REC.                                                                                                                                                       
           MOVE ACTION TO O-ACTION.                                                                                                                                                                     
           MOVE HSCREEN TO O-HSCREEN.                                                                                                                                                                   
           MOVE DATE-R TO O-DATE-R.                                                                                                                                                                     
           MOVE JOBNO TO O-JOBNO.                                                                                                                                                                       
           MOVE JOBSEQ TO O-JOBSEQ.                                                                                                                                                                     
           MOVE FA TO O-FA.                                                                                                                                                                             
           MOVE FA-AUTH TO O-FA-AUTH.                                                                                                                                                                   
           MOVE USERID-R TO O-USERID-R.                                                                                                                                                                 
           MOVE ERR-MSG TO O-ERR-MSG.                                                                                                                                                                   
       end method Pcim_Data_To_Output.                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      * MOVE INPUT-FIELDS TO PCIM-DATA FIELDS                                                                                                                                                           
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       method-id. Input_To_Pcim_Data protected.                                                                                                                                                         
       procedure division.                                                                                                                                                                              
           MOVE I-ACTION TO ACTION                                                                                                                                                                      
           MOVE I-HSCREEN TO HSCREEN                                                                                                                                                                    
           MOVE I-DATE-R TO DATE-R                                                                                                                                                                      
           MOVE I-JOBNO TO JOBNO                                                                                                                                                                        
           MOVE I-JOBSEQ TO JOBSEQ                                                                                                                                                                      
           MOVE I-FA TO FA                                                                                                                                                                              
           MOVE I-FA-AUTH TO FA-AUTH                                                                                                                                                                    
           MOVE I-USERID-R TO USERID-R                                                                                                                                                                  
           MOVE I-ERR-MSG TO ERR-MSG                                                                                                                                                                    
           MOVE D158999-REC    TO PCIM-FILE-DATA.                                                                                                                                                       
       end method Input_To_Pcim_Data.                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
      ************************************************                                                                                                                                                  
      *                                                                                                                                                                                                 
       end class.                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                        

